---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Interactive Magnetic Marble Maze"
  category="Product Design · Electronics · Embedded Systems"
  status="Completed"
  summary="A child-focused STEM toy designed and built by a four-person team using woodworking, CAD, 3D printing, electronics, and embedded code."
  tools={["CAD", "3D Printing", "Arduino", "Woodworking"]}
  team="Four-person team"
>
  <div class="case-study-page">
    <section class="case-study-card context-card">
      <div class="context-icon-slot" aria-label="Bee engineering icon">
        <img
          src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/bee_gear_emblem.png"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>

      <div class="context-copy">
        <h2>Project Context</h2>
        <p>
          Placed on a team with 3 random engineering students, we were tasked 
          with creating an original STEM toy for the local Pre-K and 1st Grade Students, 
          in a semester, using the engineering design process.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="context-icon-slot" aria-label="Bee engineering icon">
        <img
          src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/bee_gear_emblem.png"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-study-card project-phases-card">
      <div class="project-phases-copy">
        <h2>Project Phases</h2>

        <p>
          In this project, the team was tasked with developing an original STEM toy for the local children's school. 
          The project was split into multiple phases, each one having a different team leader: idea development, 
          proof of concept, 50% Completion, Completed Prototype. All of this led up to the final presentation. 
          Just as each phase had different leaders, different people would be selected in each phase for managing 
          the team schedule, updating the budget sheet, and documenting progress during each meeting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="phase-flow">

        <!-- 01 — IDEA DEVELOPMENT -->
        <div class="phase-step phase-idea">
          <div class="phase-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9 18h6" />
              <path d="M10 21h4" />
              <path d="M8.2 14.2a6 6 0 1 1 7.6 0c-.8.7-1.3 1.5-1.4 2.3H9.6c-.1-.8-.6-1.6-1.4-2.3Z" />
              <path d="M12 1.5v2" />
              <path d="M4.6 4.6 6 6" />
              <path d="M18 6l1.4-1.4" />
              <path d="M2.5 12h2" />
              <path d="M19.5 12h2" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-label">
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>Idea Development</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 02 — PROOF OF CONCEPT -->
        <div class="phase-step phase-proof">
          <div class="phase-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="6" y="4" width="12" height="17" rx="2" />
              <path d="M9 4V2h6v2" />
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
              <path d="M9 17h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-label">
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>Proof of Concept</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 03 — 50% COMPLETION -->
        <div class="phase-step phase-half">
          <div class="phase-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" />
              <path
                d="M12 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0 17Z"
                fill="currentColor"
                stroke="none"
              />
              <path d="M12 3.5v17" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-label">
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>50% Completion</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 04 — COMPLETED PROTOTYPE -->
        <div class="phase-step phase-complete">
          <div class="phase-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 4h8v4a4 4 0 0 1-8 0V4Z" />
              <path d="M8 6H4v1a4 4 0 0 0 4 4" />
              <path d="M16 6h4v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4" />
              <path d="M12 12v5" />
              <path d="M9 17h6" />
              <path d="M8 21h8" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-label">
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>Completed Prototype</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-study-card split-card">
      <div class="section-copy">
        <h2>Idea Development</h2>
        <p>
          When generating ideas, a lot of research was done regarding 
          the user: the Pre-K and 1st Grade students. Along with better understanding what 
          toys typically interest kids in that age range, the team looked at 
          their developmental age and learned where the kids needed the most growth. In the end, we decided that 
          the toy should work kids' fine motor skills, involve critical thinking, and allow some free 
          play while still having an end goal.
        </p>
        <p>
          After a few design iterations from the team, we settled on making a magnetic-marble maze. 
          The maze would incorporate electronic challenges that would require criticial thinking and 
          timing to overcome. This would keep the toy engagning and work the studnets' fine motor skills.
          We also chose to theme the toy around bees to teach the kids about 
          polination. Once the concept got approved, we went to work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="carousel-frame static-image-frame">
        <img
          src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/bee_life_infographic_poster.png"
          alt="Bee-themed concept graphic for the magnetic marble maze idea development"
        />
        <div class="carousel-caption">Final Design Concept</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-study-card split-card reverse-card">
      <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
        <div class="carousel-frame">
          <div class="carousel-slide is-active" data-slide>
            <img
              src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/cardboardimage2.png"
              alt="Close-up view of the cardboard magnetic marble maze proof-of-concept prototype"
            />
            <div class="carousel-caption">Cardboard Prototype Development</div>
          </div>

          <div class="carousel-slide" data-slide>
            <div class="carousel-image-area">
              <img
                class="rotate-counterclockwise"
                src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/totalcardboardimage.png"
                alt="Full top-down view of the cardboard magnetic marble maze prototype"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-caption">Full Cardboard Prototype</div>
          </div>

          <div class="carousel-slide" data-slide>
            <img
              src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/milestone3png.png"
              alt="Magnetic marble maze prototype at approximately fifty percent completion"
            />
            <div class="carousel-caption">50% Completion Prototype</div>
          </div>

          <button class="carousel-arrow previous" type="button" data-previous aria-label="Previous proof of concept image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" /></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="carousel-arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next proof of concept image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="carousel-dots" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="is-active" data-dot></span>
          <span data-dot></span>
          <span data-dot></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-copy">
        <h2>Proof of Concept and 50% Completion</h2>
        <p>
          For the next phase of the project, the team had to finalize some initial design choices of how the 
          toy was going to be made and create a cardboard prototype as a proof of concept. Over 
          the course of this process, the design for the three different challenges was finalized. 
        </p>
        <p>
          After creating the proof of concept, the team divided up responsibilities for 
          making the actual toy. Some of these tasks involved making the electronic code, installing some of the 
          electornics, creating the CAD for the course, and making the wooden frame of the board.
          By the end of this phase, the team was required to have completed at least 50% of the project. At this point, the 
          frame was made, intial designs of the three challenge phases were 3D printed, and one of the electronic components was 
          implemented.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-study-card split-card">
      <div class="section-copy">
        <h2>Completed Prototype & Final Presentation</h2>
        <p>
          From the 50% completion to the full prototype completion, I was 
          the leader of the group. I designated jobs based on what tasks I saw my
          groupmates were best at and enjoyed the most. All three challenge 
          stages were redesigned, reprinted, installed, and equiped with their respective electronics, 
          each containing Arduino-based embedded code.
          Transports were also made between each section for the marble, and the 
          whole board was decorated.
        </p>
        <p>
          For the various phases, buttons were used to make the marble maze 
          more interactive, requiring the kids to turn and align different paths. 
          The board was set up so that once a kid reached the end of the maze, the marble 
          would hit a switch and randomize the aligned paths, allowing the toy to automatically reset.
          The final prototype was shown to the kids and teachers, and once the group received feedback, 
          we made some final changes before the last presentation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
        <div class="carousel-frame">
          <div class="carousel-slide is-active" data-slide>
            <img
              src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/partialmilestone4.jpg"
              alt="Decorated magnetic marble maze board before all final components were installed"
            />
            <div class="carousel-caption">Partial Prototype Assembly</div>
          </div>

          <div class="carousel-slide" data-slide>
            <img
              src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/completedmilestone4.jpg"
              alt="Completed magnetic marble maze prototype with all major challenge components installed"
            />
            <div class="carousel-caption">Completed Prototype</div>
          </div>

          <div class="carousel-slide" data-slide>
            <img
              src="/images/projects/magnetic-marble-maze/finishedproduct.png"
              alt="Final magnetic marble maze with labeled components and marble paths"
            />
            <div class="carousel-caption">Final Product Overview</div>
          </div>

          <button class="carousel-arrow previous" type="button" data-previous aria-label="Previous completed prototype image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" /></svg>
          </button>
          <button class="carousel-arrow next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next completed prototype image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="carousel-dots" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="is-active" data-dot></span>
          <span data-dot></span>
          <span data-dot></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="overall-section">
      <div class="overall-heading">
        <span></span>
        <h2>Overall</h2>
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="overall-grid">
        <article class="overall-card">
          <h3>Results</h3>
          <p>
            Overall, the project was a success! The kids really enjoyed the 
            marble maze, the teachers thought that it was educational, and the electronics 
            all worked as expected! The only methods that I could see as future improvements would be 
            attaching servos to the initial maze walls that rotated on every completion, allowing the next maze operation 
            to be completely different from the previous iteration. Other than that, I was very satisfied with this project's 
            completion.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="overall-card">
          <h3>My Contributions</h3>
          <p>
            Throughout this project, I made several contributions including the cutting and assembling of the wooden 
            frame, 3D-printed piece installation, all electronic installation, all the coding, 
            and all the CAD related to the final challenge, including internal gear designs. I also functioned as the leader 
            from the 50% to full prototype completion stage; this role involved assigning team roles, scheduling meetings, and 
            gauging team progress across a timeline.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="overall-card">
          <h3>Lessons Learned</h3>
          <p>
            By the end of this project, I had strengthened my CAD, coding, and 
            electronic skills. Further, I learned a lot about creating an environment 
            for productive group idea generation and wise task alotment in a team. 
            The team collaboration I got to experience while moving through the 
            engineering design process will help me to better collaborate 
            with others when working on projects in the future. 
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</ProjectLayout>

<style>
  .case-study-page {
    display: grid;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .case-study-card {
    border: 1px solid #bfd2e5;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .context-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 760px) 150px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 46px;
    min-height: 270px;
    padding: 46px 54px;
  }

  .context-copy {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .context-copy h2,
  .section-copy h2,
  .overall-heading h2,
  .overall-card h3 {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .context-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .context-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: justify;
    text-align-last: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .context-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .context-icon-slot {
    display: grid;
    width: 160px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-items: center;
    justify-self: center;
    border: 8px solid #78aee8;
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .context-icon-slot img {
    width: 138px;
    height: 138px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .context-card > .context-icon-slot:first-child {
    transform: translateX(28px);
  }

  .context-card > .context-icon-slot:last-child {
    transform: translateX(-28px);
  }

  .project-phases-card {
    padding: 38px 48px 44px;
    border-color: #78aee8;
  }

  .project-phases-copy {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .project-phases-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .project-phases-copy h2::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: 72px;
    height: 4px;
    margin: 14px auto 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #66aaf1;
  }

  .project-phases-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .phase-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .phase-step {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 104px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .phase-step:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -17px;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-top: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-right: 2px solid currentColor;
    background: inherit;
    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);
  }

  .phase-icon {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 44px;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .phase-icon svg {
    width: 58px;
    height: 58px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2.1;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .phase-label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .phase-label span {
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .phase-label strong {
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .phase-idea {
    color: #2563c7;
    background: #eef5ff;
  }

  .phase-proof {
    color: #4b8b35;
    background: #f0f8eb;
  }

  .phase-half {
    color: #c87a00;
    background: #fff7e6;
  }

  .phase-complete {
    color: #7441a8;
    background: #f7f0ff;
  }

  .split-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.88fr) minmax(0, 1.12fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 54px;
    padding: 28px 34px;
  }

  .reverse-card {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(0, 0.88fr);
  }

  .section-copy {
    align-self: start;
    padding: 18px 14px;
  }

  .section-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 2.7vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .section-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .section-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .carousel {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .carousel-frame {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: 7px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 17px;
    background: #eaf1f8;
  }

  .carousel-slide {
    display: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .carousel-slide.is-active {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) 42px;
  }

  .carousel-slide img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .carousel-slide .carousel-caption {
    position: static;
    inset: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: auto;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d5e0ea;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-align: center;
    transform: none;
  }

  .carousel-frame.static-image-frame {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) 42px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .carousel-frame.static-image-frame > img {
    display: block;
    width: 90%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
    margin: 0 auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .carousel-frame.static-image-frame .carousel-caption {
    position: static;
    inset: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: auto;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d5e0ea;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-align: center;
    transform: none;
  }

  .carousel-image-area {
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    place-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .carousel-slide img.rotate-counterclockwise {
  width: auto;
  height: 118%;
  max-width: none;
  margin: 0 auto;
  transform: rotate(-90deg);
}

  .carousel-placeholder {
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 126, 223, 0.035), rgba(20, 126, 223, 0.09)),
      #eef4fa;
    color: #6f8297;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .carousel-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc((100% - 42px) / 2);
    display: grid;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid #d5e0ea;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    color: var(--accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(18, 32, 58, 0.12);
  }

  .carousel-arrow:hover {
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .carousel-arrow svg {
    width: 25px;
    height: 25px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .carousel-arrow.previous {
    left: 14px;
  }

  .carousel-arrow.next {
    right: 14px;
  }

  .carousel-dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 13px;
  }

  .carousel-dots span {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #cbd6e1;
  }

  .carousel-dots span.is-active {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .overall-section {
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .overall-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .overall-heading span {
    height: 2px;
    background: #a9c9e8;
  }

  .overall-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.6vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .overall-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .overall-card {
    min-height: 190px;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    border: 1px solid #91bae2;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
  }

  .overall-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 13px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .overall-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .context-card {
      grid-template-columns: 90px minmax(0, 1fr) 90px;
      gap: 26px;
      padding: 38px 30px;
    }

    .phase-flow {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .phase-step::after {
      display: none;
    }

    .split-card,
    .reverse-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .reverse-card .carousel {
      order: 2;
    }

    .reverse-card .section-copy {
      order: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .case-study-page {
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .project-phases-card {
      padding: 30px 24px;
    }

    .phase-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .context-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 30px 24px;
    }

    .context-icon-slot {
      display: none;
    }

    .context-copy p {
      text-align: left;
      text-align-last: auto;
    }

    .split-card,
    .reverse-card {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .section-copy {
      padding: 6px 2px;
    }

    .section-copy h2 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .carousel-frame {
      border-width: 5px;
    }

    .carousel-arrow {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
    }

    .overall-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-carousel]").forEach((carousel) => {
    const slides = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-slide]"));
    const dots = Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-dot]"));
    const previous = carousel.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-previous]");
    const next = carousel.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-next]");

    let activeIndex = 0;

    const showSlide = (index: number) => {
      activeIndex = (index + slides.length) % slides.length;

      slides.forEach((slide, slideIndex) => {
        const active = slideIndex === activeIndex;
        slide.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
        slide.setAttribute("aria-hidden", String(!active));
      });

      dots.forEach((dot, dotIndex) => {
        dot.classList.toggle("is-active", dotIndex === activeIndex);
      });
    };

    previous?.addEventListener("click", () => showSlide(activeIndex - 1));
    next?.addEventListener("click", () => showSlide(activeIndex + 1));

    showSlide(0);
  });
</script>